WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.209 --> 00:00:01.710
Leanne:
This is my family...

00:00:01.793 --> 00:00:04.463
...and I will not
let you take me away from them!

00:00:06.429 --> 00:00:11.000
♪♪ 

00:00:12.429 --> 00:00:12.969
♪ Here we go. ♪ 

00:00:12.971 --> 00:00:14.848
♪ Hello Matthew ♪

00:00:14.932 --> 00:00:16.934
♪ Little bumblebee, we're s-- ♪

00:00:17.809 --> 00:00:19.520
♪ So glad to see you ♪

00:00:19.603 --> 00:00:20.437
♪ How about Ella ♪

00:00:21.021 --> 00:00:21.939
A toast...

00:00:22.022 --> 00:00:23.398
to motherhood...

00:00:24.358 --> 00:00:25.776
and to new beginnings.

00:00:27.277 --> 00:00:28.070
♪ Everyone buzz like a bee. ♪ 

00:00:30.739 --> 00:00:32.491
Can I tell you something silly?

00:00:37.996 --> 00:00:39.790
Sometimes I feel like I'm cursed.

00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:42.709
I think that everything's happening
the way that it's supposed to.

00:00:46.129 --> 00:00:48.549
This cult could come back
for her at any time.

00:00:48.757 --> 00:00:50.801
None of you can protect me from them.

00:00:51.969 --> 00:00:53.595
You wouldn't even know what to look for.

00:00:56.390 --> 00:00:58.600
Are you feeding
those squatters again, Sean?

00:00:58.684 --> 00:01:00.435
They're hungry kids, Dorothy.

00:01:00.978 --> 00:01:02.688
What if they're casing the place?

00:01:03.981 --> 00:01:05.941
I forbid you to go back to that park.

00:01:06.024 --> 00:01:07.818
It's so funny how controlling you can be.

00:01:08.402 --> 00:01:09.695
I think it would be best for everyone

00:01:09.778 --> 00:01:11.697
if you were able to
make peace with Leanne.

00:01:11.780 --> 00:01:13.407
Why are you both so afraid of her?

00:01:15.868 --> 00:01:16.910
She's angry.

00:01:16.994 --> 00:01:17.953
I see.

00:01:18.036 --> 00:01:18.871
Please don't hurt her.

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:23.500
Julian, you're not telling me everything.

00:01:23.876 --> 00:01:25.419
What is going on?

00:01:28.046 --> 00:01:29.590
There's a price to pay.

00:01:31.717 --> 00:01:33.135
What the hell happens now?

00:01:34.178 --> 00:01:35.220
The end.

00:01:36.096 --> 00:01:37.472
I don't wanna lose my son again.

00:01:38.432 --> 00:01:39.516
Things are decaying.

00:01:40.976 --> 00:01:42.060
She's gotta go.

00:01:42.686 --> 00:01:45.647
The house is filled with pests.

00:01:46.190 --> 00:01:49.610
She's like this worm
that gets under your skin.

00:01:50.277 --> 00:01:51.069
This is my home.

00:01:51.904 --> 00:01:52.696
This is my family...

00:01:53.739 --> 00:01:57.034
...and I will not
let you take me away from them!

00:02:03.040 --> 00:02:04.750
God didn't bring back Jericho.

00:02:07.711 --> 00:02:08.545
Then, who did?

